    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490103588/4901035880010"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035880020,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "じ、神社のやつなので\r\n怪しいものじゃないですよ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103588/4901035880020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それは心配してないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035880030,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "す、すみません\r\nあんまり、クリスマスのプレゼントっぽくなくて",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103588/4901035880030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、嬉しいよ\r\n小糸、色々考えてこれを準備してくれたんだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035880040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……プレゼントって、どういうのがいいか\r\nいつも悩んでしまって",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103588/4901035880040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035880050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "相手の……プロデューサーさんの欲しい物って\r\nなんだろうって考えてたら",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103588/4901035880050"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035880060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんの願いが\r\n叶うようなものがいいなって……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103588/4901035880060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん\r\nすごくご利益がありそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035880070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……！\r\nそ、そうですかね……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103588/4901035880070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、この猫も可愛いし\r\n『福』って書いてあるしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035880080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、それに『福丸』からの贈り物ですからね……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
